.794, "end": 121.914}, {"i": 298, "text": "I", "start": 121.934, "end": 121.974}, {"i": 299, "text": "will", "start": 121.994, "end": 122.155}, {"i": 300, "text": "come", "start": 122.195, "end": 122.315}, {"i": 301, "text": "back", "start": 122.355, "end": 122.515}, {"i": 302, "text": "to", "start": 122.555, "end": 122.635}, {"i": 303, "text": "you", "start": 122.675, "end": 122.795}, {"i": 304, "text": "with", "start": 122.835, "end": 122.976}, {"i": 305, "text": "it.", "start": 123.056, "end": 123.156}, {"i": 306, "text": "All", "start": 123.596, "end": 123.736}, {"i": 307, "text": "right.", "start": 123.757, "end": 123.937}, {"i": 308, "text": "Thank", "start": 124.077, "end": 124.317}, {"i": 309, "text": "you.", "start": 124.337, "end": 124.497}, {"i": 310, "text": "Take", "start": 124.898, "end": 125.098}, {"i": 311, "text": "care,", "start": 125.118, "end": 125.318}, {"i": 312, "text": "Hendrik.", "start": 125.359, "end": 125.739}, {"i": 313, "text": "Goodbye.", "start": 126.18, "end": 126.52}], "segments": [{"start": 0.074, "end": 0.694, "text": "Morning, Hendrik."}, {"start": 1.215, "end": 1.835, "text": "Good to see you."}, {"start": 2.455, "end": 3.156, "text": "Come and sit down."}, {"start": 3.716, "end": 4.136, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 4.717, "end": 7.738, "text": "Did the new check-in screen at reception behave itself today?"}, {"start": 8.459, "end": 9.219, "text": "I think so."}, {"start": 9.96, "end": 11.701, "text": "I may have pressed something twice."}, {"start": 13.202, "end": 14.242, "text": "You are not the first."}, {"start": 15.043, "end": 16.143, "text": "It gets there in the end."}, {"start": 16.744, "end": 17.664, "text": "It does, yes."}, {"start": 18.445, "end": 20.606, "text": "So, this is a health check today."}, {"start": 21.226, "end": 22.627, "text": "What did you want us to look at?"}, {"start": 23.327, "end": 24.648, "text": "My cholesterol, I think."}, {"start": 25.209, "end": 26.409, "text": "I would like the level checked."}, {"start": 26.99, "end": 27.45, "text": "Of course."}, {"start": 28.254, "end": 30.295, "text": "Do you remember what it was last time?"}, {"start": 30.975, "end": 33.097, "text": "My LDL was 3.9."}, {"start": 33.697, "end": 36.058, "text": "That was back in 2021, I believe."}, {"start": 36.598, "end": 36.859, "text": "Good."}, {"start": 37.359, "end": 38.019, "text": "That helps me."}, {"start": 38.82, "end": 41.101, "text": "Any symptoms from the heart or the lungs?"}, {"start": 41.761, "end": 43.122, "text": "No, nothing like that."}, {"start": 43.582, "end": 46.704, "text": "No chest symptoms and no trouble with your breathing?"}, {"start": 47.424, "end": 49.025, "text": "No, I am not aware of any."}, {"start": 49.605, "end": 50.066, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 50.726, "end": 51.647, "text": "How is your diet?"}, {"start": 52.187, "end": 53.107, "text": "Healthy, I would say."}, {"start": 53.608, "end": 54.248, "text": "Varied enough."}, {"start": 54.948, "end": 55.669, "text": "And smoking?"}, {"start": 56.209, "end": 57.97, "text": "I was a party smoker when I was young."}, {"start": 58.534, "end": 59.235, "text": "Not since then."}, {"start": 59.895, "end": 60.155, "text": "Right."}, {"start": 60.896, "end": 61.876, "text": "What about alcohol?"}, {"start": 62.397, "end": 64.918, "text": "Two or three units a week, something like that."}, {"start": 65.619, "end": 66.52, "text": "And exercise?"}, {"start": 67.2, "end": 69.181, "text": "You have always been very active."}, {"start": 69.742, "end": 71.903, "text": "I train maybe eight to ten hours a week."}, {"start": 72.544, "end": 73.684, "text": "That is a good deal."}, {"start": 74.305, "end": 77.507, "text": "And work is still the staff manager role in the retail chain?"}, {"start": 78.067, "end": 79.308, "text": "Yes, still that."}, {"start": 79.869, "end": 82.29, "text": "Let me take your blood pressure and your pulse now."}, {"start": 82.851, "end": 83.191, "text": "Alright."}, {"start": 83.791, "end": 85.352, "text": "Your blood pressure is 135 over 86."}, {"start": 88.35, "end": 90.171, "text": "And your pulse is 62."}, {"start": 90.791, "end": 91.451, "text": "Is that all right?"}, {"start": 92.072, "end": 94.372, "text": "Those are the numbers we work from today."}, {"start": 95.013, "end": 97.714, "text": "Your body mass index is 24.9."}, {"start": 97.974, "end": 99.274, "text": "I see."}, {"start": 99.895, "end": 102.036, "text": "I also did a urine dipstick."}, {"start": 102.616, "end": 104.657, "text": "It shows blood and protein."}, {"start": 105.417, "end": 106.077, "text": "Is that bad?"}, {"start": 106.177, "end": 107.998, "text": "It means I want it looked at properly."}, {"start": 108.698, "end": 111.159, "text": "I'm sending a urine sample for analysis."}, {"start": 111.879, "end": 112.76, "text": "What are they looking for?"}, {"start": 113.46, "end": 115.961, "text": "The ratio between albumin and creatinine."}, {"start": 116.701, "end": 117.982, "text": "We are waiting for that answer."}, {"start": 118.61, "end": 119.131, "text": "So I wait."}, {"start": 119.531, "end": 119.812, "text": "Yes."}, {"start": 120.352, "end": 121.374, "text": "We wait for the result."}, {"start": 121.794, "end": 123.156, "text": "And I will come back to you with it."}, {"start": 123.596, "end": 123.937, "text": "All right."}, {"start": 124.077, "end": 124.497, "text": "Thank you."}, {"start": 124.898, "end": 125.739, "text": "Take care, Hendrik."}, {"start": 126.18, "end": 126.52, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 2.215}}